# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# Shell scripts specifically: force LF in the working tree on every
# platform, not just in the stored blob. `text=auto` alone still checks
# these out as CRLF on Windows, which breaks their shebang line the
# moment they're actually executed (in a Linux container, or via WSL/
# Git Bash) with a "bad interpreter" error. This repo is authored on
# Windows (deploy.sh's own comment already flags the related
# executable-bit gotcha), so this isn't hypothetical.
*.sh text eol=lf
